  {
   "id": "hidden-cats-in-tokyo-318961@major-2025-03-07",
   "gameId": "hidden-cats-in-tokyo-318961",
   "displayName": "Languages and Bug Fixing Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-03-07T14:05:59.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, friends!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hidden Cats in Tokyo is our biggest and most challenging hidden object game yet! Our talented artists have put in countless hours of research and illustration work, maintaining our well-established art style while incorporating elements of Japanese manga and anime. And yes—everything is 100% hand-crafted by our amazing team!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Our designers and programmers have also worked hard to implement new features and improve many aspects of the game. And, of course, we have to mention YOU, our players! Your valuable feedback keeps us motivated and inspires us to continue this journey.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nukearts is incredibly grateful for your support!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now, onto the exciting news!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Localization",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "More people around the world can now enjoy the game—especially those who appreciate its little story! Many parents play our games with their children, and we want to provide the best experience for players of all ages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "We currently support the following languages",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Brazilian Portuguese, French, German, and Japanese!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope to add even more languages in the future!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Enhanced Camera",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’ve completely reworked the camera system, allowing you to fully appreciate the art as it was meant to be seen!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Steam Community Items!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "That’s right! Trading cards will now be dropped as you play. Get ready to collect them!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Minor Updates",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Updated Controller support",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "SFX Fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the Maneki Neko QTE Achievement being skippable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved the hint system functionality.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Implemented a skip all cutscenes option in the settings menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Other Minor bug fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And there’s more to come in the future!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With all that said, we hope you continue to enjoy the game! Let us know if everything is running smoothly on your end.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Happy finding! 🎉",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
