  {
   "id": "hidden-cats-in-tokyo-318961@major-2024-12-21",
   "gameId": "hidden-cats-in-tokyo-318961",
   "displayName": "Bugs Fixing and Slight Changes Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-12-21T02:36:09.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, friends! We've heard you! We are aware that missing on a cat item/monster, having to restart to find them, wasn't the ideal way to do so, but worry not! We've decided to make them now part of the experience! Now they are required to complete a level, and even come with their own counter and preview, letting you know how many there are left to find in a level!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Not only that, in case you'd like to see the cutscenes, while playing the game normaly, they are also available at their start, being able to skipped if you want to.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have also noticed and heard some issues that we've just fixed in this update, some of these include:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Colorblind mode not working.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed a non-essential slider from the sound settings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Keyboard commands not working.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Exiting level not bringing you to level select.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Card text fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Not being able to navigate a completed level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Final level people not being clickable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Radar not working.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
